Tool response:
Tool: issue_badge
Description: Issue a digital badge to candidate Jane Smith (ID 98765) for the 'Advanced Project Management' certification (ID 1) with verification URL and metadata. The badge is issued on 2025-05-15.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "certification_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Certification Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "candidate_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Candidate Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "certification_id",
        "candidate_id"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: get_badge_metadata
Description: Fetch the metadata associated with a given verification URL for a badge, including certification name, issue date, and recipient name.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "verification_url": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Unique verification URL for the badge",
          "title": "Verification Url"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "verification_url"
      ]
    }
